            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mom_v_3"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is similar to the hot spiced wine we get when we go skying at Mont Tremblant, except this recipe is much sweeter. At the hill it is served with cinnamon sticks and sugar on the side. Will make again but cut the sugar to 1/3 of a cup. As written it is way too sweet for our taste.",
